{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Gr\u00e9goire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/Lucienne_PoseA_CloseUpTransparence616x308.png?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You\u2019ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward\u2026 and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/CuryeuxLvlv4ActivePlateforme256_616x200.gif?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong>\u00a0: sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/CuryeuxLvl3MobilePics616x200.gif?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/CuryeuxLvl2MiragePicpicLoop616x200.gif?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814650?t=1751398018","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814650?t=1751398018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/625f97c2aa5214cbf96302363ad0f12d2cf153fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751398018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/625f97c2aa5214cbf96302363ad0f12d2cf153fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751398018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Gr\u00e9goire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/Lucienne_PoseA_CloseUpTransparence616x308.png?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You\u2019ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward\u2026 and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/CuryeuxLvlv4ActivePlateforme256_616x200.gif?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong>\u00a0: sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/CuryeuxLvl3MobilePics616x200.gif?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/CuryeuxLvl2MiragePicpicLoop616x200.gif?t=1751398018\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Campus ADN 2024-2025"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/50f35e088c23a00cd183c0d960870b2e56ccc685/header.jpg?t=1751398018","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158922,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158922/movie480.mp4?t=1750965960","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158922/movie_max.mp4?t=1750965960"},"name":"BandeAnnonceAlphaCuryeux","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158922/92dfc33ea302d3870cd0783fecf504edbfb49227/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750965960","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158922/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750965960","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158922/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750965960"}}],"name":"Curyeux","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900 (24 CPUs), ~2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 65536 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 4070 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900 (24 CPUs), ~2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 65536 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 4070 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available spa